    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "SYSTEM TIMETABLE\n•\nJUNE, 1951\nUNITED\nAIR LINES\nHAWAII, USA\nOnly $326 (plus tax) from California\nfor 10 wonderful days in\nthe Islands!\nDetails of other\nlow-expense United\nVacations inside.",
      "TIME\nHAWAII\nTO EDMONTON\nTIME\nSEATTLE\nTACOMA\n• SPOKANE\nCUT\u0026 BANK\nREGIN\nPORTLAND,\nMISSOULA\nWALLA WALLA\nPENDLETON\nGREAT FALLS\nTHALLES\nBEND. • REDMOND\nMILES CITY\nSUN VALLEY\nWEST -YELLOWSTONE\nSMEKIDAN\nTALES\nJACKSON\n¡ POCATELLO\nKAPID CITY\nRED BLUFF\nCASPER\nHUCK SPRINGS\nPLATTE\nOAKLAND\nSAN FRANCISCO\nELKO\nSALT LAKE CITY\nDEL MOI\nSTOCKTON\nMODESTO\nFRESNO\n] VISALIA\nGKAND JUNCTIO\nDENVER.\n2 CEDAR CITY\nLAS VEGAS\nHOOVER\nSANTA BARBARA\nRHORANK\nLOS ANGELES\nCATALINA\nSAN DIEGO\n• LONG BEACH\nWINSLOW\nALBUOU-KOU\nAMARILLO\nTUCSON\nNOGALES\"\nCANANEA\nCHIMUAHUA\nPARKA\nDURANGO\nMATESA!\nCENTKAL\nHURON\nMINNEAPOLIS\nSAINT PAUL\nROCHESTER\nSIOUX FALLS\nMILWAUKEE\nLOES MOINES\nLINCOLN.\n/ CEDAR RAPIDS\nGRAND ISLAND\nKANSAS CITY\nSAINT LOUIS\nNICHITA\nOKLAHOMA CIT\n-MEMPH\nLITTLE ROCK\nBIRMINGHAM\nSHREVEPORT,\nHOUSTONY\nSAN ANTONIQ\nNEW ORLEANS\nLAREDO\nBROWNSVILLE\nMERIC\nEASTERN\nTO EUROPE\nKAPUSKASING\"\nNUKH BA\nMONTREAL,\nOTTANA\nBANGOR,\nAUGUSTAS\nPORTLANT\n• DETROIT T\nSURTADE\n- CLEVELAND*\nPADFORD\nBOSTON\nALBANY\nSPRINGFIELDY\nAPROVIDENCI\nHARTFORD\n- ALLENTOWN-BETHLEHEM-EASTON\n•NEW YORK\nTOLEDO AKRON\n\"COLUMBUS\n/DAYTON\nCINCINNATI\n*PITTSBURGH\nPHILADELPHiA\n•BALTIMOR\nWASHINGTON\nTO BERMUDA\nAND LONDON\nLOUISViLLE\nKNOXVILLE\nATLANTA\nKEY\nUnited Air Lines\nOther Air Lines\n...\n(proposed)\nIn Mexico\nLAMSA Airlines\nFrom Nogales and El Pase\nUNITED\nFAIR LINES\nACKSONVILLE\nVALLAHASSS\nOUTH AMERICA\nTORREON\nKET HA\nA FRESNILLO\nTO LATIN AMERIC\nSTO PUERTO RICE\nSAN LUIS POTOSI\nMEXICO CITY\nMORE SEATS\nFOR PASSENGERS!\nMORE SPACE FOR SHIPPERS!\nNow - Most Complete Service Ever Offered on United's Main Line Airway\nUnited's new spring-summer schedules offer more Mainliner service\ncoast to coast and border to border than at any other time in our quarter-\ncentury history. There are 56 United flights daily from Chicago alone!\nNew daylight and overnight DC-6 Mainliner 300 flights have been\nscheduled to provide additional service for coast-to-coast passengers\nand shippers. At the same time, United has made available more\nfrequent DC-6 Mainliner 300 nonstops each way between Chicago and\nmajor cities on both coasts.\nNOW, MORE THAN EVER, UNITED IS THE FAST, CONVENIENT WAY TO SHIP AND TRAVEL!"
